{"layout": [], "most_frequent_angle": 0, "ocr": [{"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[298.0, 71.0], [693.0, 62.0], [696.0, 209.0], [302.0, 218.0]], "score": 0.9990177154541016, "text": "COPIE"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[724.0, 71.0], [1533.0, 86.0], [1531.0, 192.0], [722.0, 177.0]], "score": 0.6731938123703003, "text": "Cerfe conforme par le fant,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[774.0, 203.0], [2168.0, 221.0], [2168.0, 277.0], [773.0, 260.0]], "score": 0.9715031385421753, "text": "Acte de cession de parts sociales Jagqueß BOCKEL à Mathieu DOMENEGHETTY"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[330.0, 301.0], [958.0, 310.0], [957.0, 361.0], [330.0, 352.0]], "score": 0.9989931583404541, "text": "4. Agrément des cessionnaires"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[334.0, 441.0], [2161.0, 457.0], [2161.0, 498.0], [333.0, 482.0]], "score": 0.9915996193885803, "text": "Aux termes de l'article 8 des statuts \"Cession et transmission des parts sociales\" les parts sociales sont librement"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[77.0, 470.0], [99.0, 463.0], [107.0, 491.0], [85.0, 498.0]], "score": 0.42277634143829346, "text": "y"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[334.0, 487.0], [2161.0, 503.0], [2161.0, 544.0], [333.0, 528.0]], "score": 0.9964696168899536, "text": "cessibles entre associés. Toutes les autres cessions sont soumises à agrément. En conséquence, il est nécessaire"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[335.0, 533.0], [1451.0, 540.0], [1450.0, 581.0], [335.0, 574.0]], "score": 0.9994402527809143, "text": "d'agréer Mr Mathieu DOMENEGHETTY en tant que nouvel associé."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[335.0, 624.0], [2161.0, 636.0], [2161.0, 677.0], [335.0, 665.0]], "score": 0.9957258701324463, "text": "Monsieur Jacques Bockel, Mme Véronique SCHOTT et Mr Jérémy BOCKEL ici présents, représentants plus de"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[335.0, 669.0], [2022.0, 679.0], [2022.0, 723.0], [335.0, 713.0]], "score": 0.9908556938171387, "text": "trois quarts des parts sociales, déclarent donner leur consentement à la présente cession de parts sociales."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[335.0, 867.0], [549.0, 867.0], [549.0, 915.0], [335.0, 915.0]], "score": 0.9987560510635376, "text": "5. Cession"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[333.0, 982.0], [2163.0, 983.0], [2163.0, 1029.0], [333.0, 1028.0]], "score": 0.9969615936279297, "text": "Le cédant cède et transporte, sous les garanties ordinaires de fait et de droit, au cessionnaire qui accepte, 3.8% du"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[335.0, 1028.0], [2163.0, 1029.0], [2163.0, 1076.0], [335.0, 1074.0]], "score": 0.9973908066749573, "text": "capital social soit 76 parts sociales de la Société, qui lui appartient, avec tous les droits et obligations attachés"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[338.0, 1077.0], [862.0, 1077.0], [862.0, 1117.0], [338.0, 1117.0]], "score": 0.9953607320785522, "text": "dans les proportions ci-dessous :"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1301.0, 1168.0], [1500.0, 1168.0], [1500.0, 1209.0], [1301.0, 1209.0]], "score": 0.9912842512130737, "text": "Nombre de"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1582.0, 1164.0], [1886.0, 1168.0], [1885.0, 1211.0], [1581.0, 1207.0]], "score": 0.9999051690101624, "text": "Nombre de parts"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[617.0, 1191.0], [756.0, 1186.0], [757.0, 1231.0], [618.0, 1235.0]], "score": 0.996661365032196, "text": "Associé"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1282.0, 1214.0], [1516.0, 1209.0], [1517.0, 1251.0], [1283.0, 1257.0]], "score": 0.9726187586784363, "text": "parts sociales"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1603.0, 1211.0], [1864.0, 1211.0], [1864.0, 1252.0], [1603.0, 1252.0]], "score": 0.996069610118866, "text": "sociales cédées"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[620.0, 1269.0], [1013.0, 1263.0], [1014.0, 1311.0], [621.0, 1317.0]], "score": 0.9978545904159546, "text": "Mr Jacques BOCKEL"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1350.0, 1260.0], [1454.0, 1260.0], [1454.0, 1312.0], [1350.0, 1312.0]], "score": 0.9907760620117188, "text": "1 776"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1706.0, 1262.0], [1765.0, 1262.0], [1765.0, 1313.0], [1706.0, 1313.0]], "score": 0.9998849630355835, "text": "76"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[281.0, 1318.0], [299.0, 1318.0], [299.0, 1335.0], [281.0, 1335.0]], "score": 0.7032231092453003, "text": "o"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[621.0, 1335.0], [770.0, 1335.0], [770.0, 1378.0], [621.0, 1378.0]], "score": 0.9998623728752136, "text": "TOTAL"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1347.0, 1332.0], [1456.0, 1332.0], [1456.0, 1383.0], [1347.0, 1383.0]], "score": 0.989366352558136, "text": "1 776"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1706.0, 1330.0], [1765.0, 1330.0], [1765.0, 1385.0], [1706.0, 1385.0]], "score": 0.9994052052497864, "text": "76"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[338.0, 1440.0], [2166.0, 1433.0], [2166.0, 1474.0], [338.0, 1481.0]], "score": 0.9900789856910706, "text": "Le cessionnaire aura la propriété des parts cédées à compter du 07 août 2007. Il aura seul droit à la fraction des"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[340.0, 1484.0], [2166.0, 1479.0], [2166.0, 1520.0], [340.0, 1525.0]], "score": 0.9918610453605652, "text": "bénéfices de l'exercice en cours qui sera, le cas échéant, attribué aux dites parts. Il sera subrogé dans tous les"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[342.0, 1530.0], [2166.0, 1524.0], [2166.0, 1565.0], [342.0, 1572.0]], "score": 0.9848396182060242, "text": "droits et obligations attachés aux parts cédées à compter du 07 août 2007, à l'exception du droit à dividendes"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[342.0, 1577.0], [933.0, 1571.0], [934.0, 1614.0], [342.0, 1619.0]], "score": 0.9781453013420105, "text": "pour l'exercice clos au 30 juin 2007."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[342.0, 1667.0], [2166.0, 1659.0], [2166.0, 1700.0], [342.0, 1708.0]], "score": 0.9866960644721985, "text": "Les parts cédées ne sont représentées par aucun titre et leur propriété résulte des statuts et des actes qui ont pu les"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[343.0, 1710.0], [498.0, 1710.0], [498.0, 1753.0], [343.0, 1753.0]], "score": 0.9996225833892822, "text": "modifier."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[342.0, 1900.0], [491.0, 1900.0], [491.0, 1949.0], [342.0, 1949.0]], "score": 0.9449993371963501, "text": "6. Prix"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[345.0, 2014.0], [2173.0, 2006.0], [2173.0, 2054.0], [345.0, 2062.0]], "score": 0.9837362766265869, "text": "Compte tenu des capitaux propres de la société et de la faible participation achetée, les cessions des parts"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[349.0, 2064.0], [1727.0, 2057.0], [1728.0, 2098.0], [349.0, 2105.0]], "score": 0.9961873888969421, "text": "sociales sont acceptées et consenties respectivement pour le prix de vente ci-dessous :"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[2064.0, 2066.0], [2413.0, 2031.0], [2425.0, 2161.0], [2076.0, 2196.0]], "score": 0.49510443210601807, "text": "new cegt"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1098.0, 2199.0], [1296.0, 2199.0], [1296.0, 2240.0], [1098.0, 2240.0]], "score": 0.9635835289955139, "text": "Nombre de"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1418.0, 2194.0], [1729.0, 2194.0], [1729.0, 2240.0], [1418.0, 2240.0]], "score": 0.9564151763916016, "text": "Nombre de parts"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1757.0, 2196.0], [1848.0, 2196.0], [1848.0, 2240.0], [1757.0, 2240.0]], "score": 0.9994133114814758, "text": "Prix"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1877.0, 2194.0], [1940.0, 2194.0], [1940.0, 2242.0], [1877.0, 2242.0]], "score": 0.9999157786369324, "text": "de"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1964.0, 2197.0], [2071.0, 2197.0], [2071.0, 2240.0], [1964.0, 2240.0]], "score": 0.9999427795410156, "text": "vente"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[2098.0, 2198.0], [2344.0, 2148.0], [2364.0, 2246.0], [211